uding shared ancestry/ethnicity), religion, sex, age, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, pregnancy or pregnancy-related condition, genetic information, marital or parental status, veteran's status, or other protected characteristic. Veterans and individuals with disabilities are encouraged to apply. Clery Statement In compliance with the Jeanne Clery Campus Safety Act and Campus Crime Statistics Act, the University of North Dakota publishes an Annual Security and Fire Safety Report. The report includes the university’s policies, procedures, and programs concerning safety and security, as well as three years of crime statistics for our campus. As a prospective employee, you are entitled to a copy of this report. The report and statistical data can be found online at UND.edu. You may also request a paper copy of the report from the UND Police Department located at 3851 Campus Road, Grand Forks, ND, 58202. Before you go! Want to be notified of jobs as we post them? First Name (required) bbe3ac0c Last Name (required) b76d01e8 Email (required) 09c00176 Job Alert 8666de8f Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments Sports Medicine Sports Medicine Categories Non-Tenure-Track Faculty Non-Tenure-Track Faculty Employment Type Full-time Faculty Full-time Faculty Locations Grand Forks, North Dakota, United States Grand Forks, North Dakota, United States Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at UND. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). By submitting your information, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to our Terms of Use . Thank you f